{"id": "EE_0024", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_1787", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 35kV 系统中性点经消弧线圈接地,全系统单相接地时的电容电流 Ic=20A,采用过补偿 10%。已知系统相电压 Uφ=35/√3 kV、频率 50Hz。求消弧线圈的实际电流 IL(A)及对应电感 L(H)。", "options": ["A. IL≈20A,L≈3.2H", "B. IL≈22A,L≈2.93H", "C. IL≈25A,L≈2.6H", "D. IL≈18A,L≈3.6H"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "正确答案:IL≈22A,L≈2.93H。IL=1.1×Ic=1.1×20=22A;L=Uφ/(ω·IL)=(35000/√3)/(2π×50×22)=20207/6912=2.93H。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0024.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2017", "paper": "供配电_专业案例_上午", "original_file": "2017年电气工程师供配电专业案例考试真题上午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "redone"}
{"id": "EE_0035", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_1857", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 500kV 超高压输电线路采用 4×LGJ-400/35 分裂导线,实测线路波阻抗 Zc=296Ω,额定电压 U=500kV。按自然功率公式 Pc=U²/Zc,求该线路的自然功率(MW)。", "options": ["A. 约 845MW", "B. 约 487MW", "C. 约 675MW", "D. 约 950MW"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "正确答案:约 845 MW(Pc = U²/Zc = 500²/296 = 250000/296 = 844.6 MW ≈ 845 MW)。Pc=U²/Zc=500²/296=250000/296=844.6MW≈845MW。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0035.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2017", "paper": "供配电_专业知识_下午", "original_file": "2017年电气工程师供配电专业知识考试真题及答案下午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "redone"}
{"id": "EE_0050", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_2202", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某档输电线路档距 l=400m,导线单位长度自重荷载 w=10N/m,导线最低点水平张力 T0=20000N。按抛物线公式 f=w·l²/(8·T0) 求该档导线中点的最大弧垂(m)。", "options": ["A. 8m", "B. 10m", "C. 12m", "D. 15m"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "正确答案:10m。f=w·l²/(8·T0)=10×400²/(8×20000)=10×160000/160000=10m。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0050.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2019", "paper": "专业知识_下午", "original_file": "2019年注册电气工程师专业知识考试真题及答案下午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "redone"}
{"id": "EE_0059", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_2396", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 110kV 输电线路位于海拔 1000m 以下、d 级以下污秽区,采用 XP-70 普通盘形悬式绝缘子。按设计规程,该电压等级线路每串悬垂绝缘子的片数(零值绝缘子除外)一般不少于多少片?", "options": ["A. 5片", "B. 6片", "C. 7片", "D. 8片"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "正确答案:7片。规程规定:110kV 线路每串悬垂绝缘子不少于 7 片(220kV 不少于 13 片,500kV 不少于 25 片)。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0059.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2020", "paper": "发输变电_专业案例_下午", "original_file": "2020年注册电气工程师发输变电专业案例考试真题及答案下午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "redone"}
{"id": "EE_0060", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_2397", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 220kV 单回线路导线水平排列,采用悬垂绝缘子串长 λ=2.5m,导线弧垂 f=18m,运行电压 U=220kV。按导线水平相间距离经验公式 D=0.4λ+U/110+0.65√f(m),求水平线间距离 D(m)。", "options": ["A. 约 4.8m", "B. 约 5.0m", "C. 约 5.76m", "D. 约 6.5m"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "正确答案:约 5.76m。D=0.4×2.5+220/110+0.65×√18=1.0+2.0+0.65×4.243=1.0+2.0+2.758=5.76m。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0060.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2020", "paper": "发输变电_专业案例_下午", "original_file": "2020年注册电气工程师发输变电专业案例考试真题及答案下午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "redone"}
{"id": "EE_0061", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_2398", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "某 110kV 线路导线外径 d=21.5mm、截面 A=280mm²,空气密度 1.225kg/m³,风载体型系数 μs=1.2,设计风速 v=25m/s。按风压比载公式 g4=0.6125·μs·d·v²/A(×10⁻³ N/(m·mm²)),求导线风压比载。", "options": ["A. 约 33.2×10⁻³", "B. 约 40.0×10⁻³", "C. 约 35.3×10⁻³", "D. 约 29.4×10⁻³"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "正确答案:约 35.3×10⁻³ N/(m·mm²)。g4=0.6125×1.2×21.5×25²/280×10⁻³=0.6125×1.2×21.5×625/280×10⁻³;分子=0.6125×1.2×21.5×625=9890.6;÷280=35.32×10⁻³ N/(m·mm²)。", "has_image": true, "images": ["EE_0061.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2020", "paper": "发输变电_专业案例_下午", "original_file": "2020年注册电气工程师发输变电专业案例考试真题及答案下午卷.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "redone"}
