{"id": "EQ_0010", "source": "5.18benchmark", "source_id": "EQ_0143", "question_type": "multiple_choice", "domain": "electrical_engineering", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "请回答图片中的问题。", "options": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "答案：**D**\n\n梁的最大正应力满足：\n\n$$\\sigma_{\\max}=\\frac{M_{\\max}}{W}$$\n\n截面相同时，只需比较最大弯矩：\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\n(A)\\quad &M_{\\max}=\\frac{PL}{4}\\\n(B)\\quad &M_{\\max}=\\frac{P(L/3)(2L/3)}{L}=\\frac{2PL}{9}\\\n(C)\\quad &M_{\\max}=\\frac{P(L/4)(3L/4)}{L}=\\frac{3PL}{16}\n\\end{aligned}$$\n\nD 中上部横梁将集中力 $P$ 分成两个 $P/2$，分别作用于主梁的 $L/4$ 和 $3L/4$ 处，因此：\n\n$$M_{\\max}=\\frac{PL}{8}$$\n\n比较可得：\n\n$$\\frac{PL}{8}<\\frac{3PL}{16}<\\frac{2PL}{9}<\\frac{PL}{4}$$\n\n所以 D 方式最大弯矩最小，正应力最小，加载方式最好。\n\n$$\\boxed{D}$$", "has_image": true, "images": ["EQ_0010.png"], "metadata": {"year": "2005", "paper": "公共基础", "original_file": "2005年注册电气工程师公共基础考试真题及答案.doc"}, "major_category": "power_grid", "minor_category": "transmission_line", "modified": "guide"}
